        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage Omega Grade 1 Commercial Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe slender, curved Schlage Omega Lever is available in a full range of commercial locking functions to meet all application needs. Built tough, this ANSI Grade 1 commercial leverset has a 7 year mechanical warranty and is UL listed for 3 hour fire doors. The available door thickness rages from 1-5/8\" to 2-1/8\"; and the available backsets include 2-3/8\", 2-3/4\", 3-3/4\", and 5\". \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Schlage Omega ND-Series Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets BHMA standards at 3,000,000 cycles.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2-2003, Series 4000 Grade 1.</li>\r\n<li>UL fire rated for 3 hour fire door.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed functions with 6-pin, C123 keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Comes Packaged with two keys per lock.</li>\r\n<li>7-year mechanical warranty for all functions.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omega Schlage Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" to 2-1/8\".</li>\r\n<li>Available Backsets: 2-3/4\" (70 mm), 2-3/8\" (60 mm), 3-3/4\" (95 mm) and 5\" (127 mm).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-latching and non-locking. Used for one side of door as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (ANSI F75):</b> Latching only, both levers always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (ANSI F76):</b> Locked by the use of a push-button located on the inside lever. Outside emergency unlocking with screwdriver (not included). Turning inside lever or closing door releases button. Inside lever is alway free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Classroom Lock (ANSI F84):</b> Outside lever locked and unlocked by key. Inside lever is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Entrance Lock (ANSI F109):</b> Pushing and turning the button on the inside lever locks outside lever. The use of key to enter from the outside is required until button is manually unlocked. On the other hand, just pushing the button on the inside lever and not turning it, locks the outside lever until it is unlocked by a key from the exterior or by turning the inside lever. Inside lever is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock (ANSI F86):</b> The outside lever is fixed. Entrance from the outside is done only by the use of a key. The inside lever is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Omega Grade 1 Commercial Lever, Schlage ND-OME",
                "description": "Schlage ND-Series Omega Commercial Lever ND-OME - The slender, curved Schlage Omega Lever is available in a full range of commercial locking functions to meet all application needs. Built tough, this ANSI Grade 1 commercial leverset has a 7 year mechanical warranty and is UL listed for 3 hour fire doors. The available door thickness rages from 1-5/8 inches to 2-1/8 inches; and the available backsets include 2-3/8 inches, 2-3/4 inches, 3-3/4 inches, and 5 inches. ",
                "keywords": "Schlage Omega levers, schlage ND-Series, ND-Locks, Schlage Omega commercial levers, Omega Commercial Lever Locks, schlage heavy duty locks, SCH-ND-ome, ul fired rated door levers, grade 1 door hardware, Omega schlage levers,  schlage nd ome, Schlage Omega Commercial Levers,"
